  "q": "Amazon routinely runs ads throughout the year to get consumers to shop on their website. In addition, during various holidays and for prime day, Amazon runs even more ads as they know consumers are more likely to purchase products on Amazon throughout that time period. Therefore, as described in the scenario, Amazon is utilizing a _________ ad strategy.",
