  "q": "Kylie works in sales for a makeup company called Clinique. She and her team are looking to sell a line of mascaras to drugstores such as CVS, Walgreens, and RiteAid. Kylie conducts research about these drug stores and prepares a presentation before meeting these clients. What stage of the selling process is Kylie in?",
