  "a": 1,
  "why": "Seg 12. February 27 th , part 2, 34:05 Correct answer: The correct personal selling stages in order are: “1. Prospecting, 2. Pre-Approach, 3. Approach, 4. Presentation, 5. Close, 6. Follow-Up” Incorrect answers: Option “1. Identifying, 2. Approach, 3. Presentation, 4. Selling, 5. Close, 6. Re-Approach” is wrong because “Identifying” and “Selling” are not stages in the personal selling process. Option “1. Prospecting, 2. Pre-Approach, 3. Presentation, 4. Approach, 5. Follow-Up, 6. Selling” is wrong because “Selling” is not a stage in the personal selling process. Option “1. Identifying, 2. Pre-Approach, 3. Approach, 4. Presentation, 5. Follow-Up, 6. Close” is wrong because “Identifying” is not a stage in the personal selling process. Option “1. Pre-Approach, 2. Approach, 3. Prospecting, 4. Presentation, 5. Close, 6. Follow-Up” is wrong because “Prospecting” is the first stage in the personal selling process.",
