  "src": "T",
  "q": "Harley Quinn is trying to sell her new line of cupcakes to Poison Ivy. During this stage, she is gathering more information about Poison Ivy than she knew so far, and she is also preparing and practicing her presentation for the pitch. What stage of the selling process is Harley Quinn currently in?",
